OL,3,GNEWSAWelsh students to start repaying
OL,4,Aloans earlier after thresholds frozen
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe income level at which Welsh
OL,7,Fgraduates start repaying loans is to be
OL,8,Ffrozen, the Welsh government has
OL,9,Fannounced.
OL,11,FIn a move which has already proved
OL,12,Fcontroversial in England, the threshold
OL,13,Ffor Plan 2 loans will be frozen at
OL,14,F#29,385 between 2027 and 2030, rather
OL,15,Fthan rising with inflation.
OL,17,FIt means graduates will start repaying
OL,18,Ftheir loans sooner than they would
OL,19,Fotherwise have done as they are likely
OL,20,Fto meet the salary threshold earlier.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,436,430,260,140,0,100
